            ],
            "description": "Use \"background\" for most agents — you will be automatically notified when they complete, and can continue other work in the meantime. Use \"sync\" only for quick, simple tasks where you need the result immediately to proceed. Use \"background\" when you plan to send follow-up messages to refine the agent's work."
          }
        },
        "required": [
