        "306.       promises.md                ← Reader promises (Chekhov's guns) — planted, status\n" +
        '307.     revision/\n' +
        '308.       developmental/\n' +
        '309.         ch-01.md ... ch-N.md     ← Per-chapter developmental edit findings\n' +
