Domain: "fantasy-writer" — an autonomous multi-agent system that writes romantic fantasy fiction.

Your job: Analyze exemplar agent families to extract hierarchy patterns, naming conventions, routing idioms, and artifact patterns for reuse in building the fantasy-writer system.

Key inputs:
- `.fractal-factory/domain-model.json` — the domain model with subdomains, invariants, and existing assets
