Focus on:
1. Hierarchy patterns (orchestrator → coordinator → specialist)
2. Naming conventions (prefixes, suffixes, role naming)
3. Routing table structure and idioms
4. Artifact contracts (status.json, manifest.json, domain-model.json patterns)
5. Prompt template structure
6. Skill mounting patterns
7. Any anti-patterns to avoid

Write your status to `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-exemplar-analyzer/status.json` when done.
