        '42. | `agents/fractal-factory-checklist-validator/status.json` | `result: "fail"` | Dispatch `fractal-factory-audit-oracle` (proceed even with failures — audit adds different perspective) |\n' +
        '43. | `agents/fractal-factory-audit-oracle/status.json` | missing | Dispatch `fractal-factory-audit-oracle` |\n' +
        '44. | `agents/fractal-factory-audit-oracle/status.json` | `result: "clean"` | Write own status: `result: "verified"` |\n' +
        '45. | `agents/fractal-factory-audit-oracle/status.json` | `result: "issues-found"` | Write own status: `result: "verified-with-issues"` |\n' +
        '46. \n' +
        '47. **Dispatch order**: checklist-validator → audit-oracle (sequential — oracle benefits from seeing validator results)\n' +
        '48. \n' +
        '49. ## Write Rules\n' +
