        '### Design Summary\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**42 artifacts** designed across the romantic-fantasy-writer produced system:\n' +
        '\n' +
        '- **4 universal**: story-config, progress, manifest, status (infrastructure)\n' +
        '- **38 domain-specific** covering all 14 subdomains and 10 creative phases:\n' +
        '  - **Concept** (2): story-concept + craft-profile\n' +
        '  - **Worldbuilding** (5): 5 subcategorized world-bible files (INV-032/INV-074)\n' +
        '  - **Character** (3): roster + per-character profiles + romance arc design\n' +
        '  - **Plotting** (4): structure + dual-arc timeline + per-chapter outlines + tension map\n' +
        '  - **Style** (1): voice calibration + prose quality floor\n' +
        '  - **Drafting** (2/ch): draft.md + metadata per chapter\n' +
        '  - **Revision** (4/ch): 3 edit reports + revised chapter per chapter\n' +
        '  - **Beta Reading** (6/ch): 5 independent lens reports + synthesis per chapter\n' +
        '  - **Polish & Delivery** (3): final chapters + summaries + delivery report\n' +
        '  - **Cross-cutting** (8): adversarial gates, 6 R-M-W trackers, series KB\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**8 multi-writer artifacts** with explicit read-modify-write contracts, ownership fields, and merge rules — ensuring no data conflicts between the chapter-drafter, continuity-tracker, and craft-tracker agents that update shared state per chapter.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**27 data flow connections** forming an acyclic primary chain with 3 intentional bounded loops (revision↔beta severity-gated, intra-phase self-loops, cross-book series KB).\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**81 invariants** all have at least one artifact enforcement path traced in the design.'
