        '9.         "displayName": "Meta-Knowledge Curation",\n' +
        '10.         "purpose": "Curate accumulated meta-knowledge from prior factory runs into a task-relevant knowledge-brief.json. On cold start (first run), produce a minimal brief acknowledging no prior signals exist. On subsequent runs, distill craft-domain signals (prose patterns, worldbuilding consistency strategies, invariant enforcement lessons) into actionable guidance for downstream passes.",\n' +
