        '15.         "parallelizable": false,\n' +
        '16.         "notes": "Cold start for this run (first fantasy-writer session). Future runs will have craft-domain signals from the synthesis pass to curate. This pass is a no-op structurally but establishes the knowledge-brief.json contract for downstream consumers."\n' +
