        '39.         "parallelizable": true,\n' +
        `40.         "notes": "Three independent analyses run in parallel: pipeline-architect designs the produced system's pass structure (this agent — designing the factory pipeline); artifact-designer maps the 30+ artifact types across 14 subdomains into schemas with read-modify-write contracts; depth-analyzer evaluates each subdomain's complexity against the maxDepth=3 budget and maxAgents=80 ceiling. The high complexity of 7 subdomains (worldbuilding, character-development, plotting, chapter-drafting, revision, beta-reading, adversarial-consistency) plus 81 invariants strongly suggests depth-3 is needed for creative phases. CURRENTLY IN PROGRESS."\n` +
