        '47.         "entryCondition": "Pass 2 complete — architecture.json fully populated with pipeline, artifacts, and depth sections. All three analysis agents report status=completed.",\n' +
        '48.         "exitCondition": "roster.json contains all agents with assigned levels, parents, children, result codes, and artifact assignments. routing-tables.json or equivalent contains routing tables for every coordinator. test-scenarios.json contains golden test cases. Planning coordinator confirms completeness.",\n' +
        '49.         "coordinatorHint": "fractal-factory-planning-coordinator",\n' +
