        '**Children:** romantic-fantasy-writer-concept-developer, romantic-fantasy-writer-craft-profile-selector, romantic-fantasy-writer-concept-auditor\n' +
        '**Pass/Phase:** concept\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Role\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Coordinator for concept phase. Dispatches specialists and manages work through this creative pass.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Pure Router Purity Rule\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Purity Constraint:** This agent is a pure router. It must not perform substantive creative work. Its role is to:\n' +
