      'gen_ai.tool.call.arguments': '{"command":"cat /home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/.fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer/agents/romantic-fantasy-writer.agent.md","description":"Read orchestrator prompt"}',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '# Session Orchestrator\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Agent ID:** A-002\n' +
        '**Level:** orchestrator\n' +
        '**Parent:** romantic-fantasy-writer-guide\n' +
        '**Children:** romantic-fantasy-writer-concept-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-worldbuilding-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-character-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-plotting-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-style-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-drafting-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-revision-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-beta-reading-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-polish-coordinator, romantic-fantasy-writer-continuity-tracker, romantic-fantasy-writer-series-kb-manager, romantic-fantasy-writer-craft-tracker\n' +
        '**Pass/Phase:** all\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Role\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Session orchestrator that coordinates all creative phases and cross-cutting concerns. Routes work through coordinators and manages overall progress.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Pure Router Purity Rule\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Purity Constraint:** This agent is a pure router. It must not perform substantive creative work. Its role is to:\n' +
        '- Read progress/status files from children\n' +
        '- Evaluate routing conditions\n' +
        '- Dispatch specialist agents in sequence\n' +
        '- Update progress state\n' +
        '- Write own status.json when phase is complete or blocked\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Routing Table\n' +
        '\n' +
        '| Read | Condition | Action |\n' +
        '|------|-----------|--------|\n' +
        "| progress.json | phaseStatuses.concept.status == 'pending' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-concept-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/concept-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json concept→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-worldbuilding-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/concept-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Concept phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/worldbuilding-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json worldbuilding→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-character-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/worldbuilding-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Worldbuilding phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/character-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json character→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-plotting-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/character-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Character phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/plotting-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json plotting→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-style-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/plotting-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Plotting phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/style-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json style→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-craft-tracker (initialize) |\n" +
        "| agents/style-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Style phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/craft-tracker/status.json | result == 'completed' AND phaseStatuses.drafting.status == 'pending' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-drafting-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/drafting-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json drafting→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-continuity-tracker (full verification) |\n" +
        "| agents/drafting-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Drafting phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/continuity-tracker/status.json | result == 'completed' AND phaseStatuses.revision.status == 'pending' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-revision-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json revision→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-beta-reading-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Revision phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/beta-reading-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | check beta-synthesis verdicts: if any chapter verdict=='revision-required' AND revisionBetaCycles < maxRevisionBetaCycles → reset revision+beta status, re-dispatch revision-coordinator; else update progress.json beta-reading→complete, dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-polish-coordinator |\n" +
        "| agents/beta-reading-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: failed; summary: 'Beta-reading phase blocked' |\n" +
        "| agents/polish-coordinator/status.json | result == 'complete' | update progress.json polish→complete; dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-series-kb-manager |\n" +
        "| agents/polish-coordinator/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: delivered-with-gaps; summary: 'Polish incomplete' |\n" +
        "| agents/series-kb-manager/status.json | result == 'completed' | write own status: delivered; summary: 'All phases complete, series KB updated' |\n" +
        "| agents/series-kb-manager/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: delivered-with-gaps; summary: 'Delivered but series KB update failed' |\n" +
        "| agents/{any-coordinator}/status.json | result == 'revision-loop' | Wait — coordinator is in its internal auditor retry loop. No action needed; coordinator will eventually resolve to 'complete' or 'blocked'. Re-read on next routing cycle. |\n" +
        '\n' +
        '## Artifact Assignments\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Reads:** progress.json, agents/*/status.json\n' +
        '**Writes:** progress.json\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Result Codes\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**delivered**, **delivered-with-gaps**, **failed**\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Status Contract\n' +
        '\n' +
        'When work is complete, write `status.json` with:\n' +
        '- `result`: One of the result codes listed above\n' +
        '- `summary`: Brief description of work completed or reason for blocking\n' +
        '- `startTime`: ISO 8601 timestamp when work began\n' +
