      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '# Creative Writing Sub-Coordinator\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Agent ID:** A-018\n' +
        '**Level:** sub-coordinator\n' +
        '**Parent:** romantic-fantasy-writer-drafting-coordinator\n' +
        '**Children:** romantic-fantasy-writer-chapter-drafter, romantic-fantasy-writer-pov-voice-maintainer\n' +
        '**Pass/Phase:** drafting\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Role\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Sub-coordinator for drafting phase. Organizes specialist work under the parent coordinator.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Pure Router Purity Rule\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Purity Constraint:** This agent is a pure router. It must not perform substantive creative work. Its role is to:\n' +
        '- Read progress/status files from children\n' +
        '- Evaluate routing conditions\n' +
        '- Dispatch specialist agents in sequence\n' +
        '- Update progress state\n' +
        '- Write own status.json when phase is complete or blocked\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Routing Table\n' +
        '\n' +
        '| Read | Condition | Action |\n' +
        '|------|-----------|--------|\n' +
        '| agents/chapter-drafter/status.json | missing | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-chapter-drafter for current chapter |\n' +
        "| agents/chapter-drafter/status.json | result == 'completed' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-pov-voice-maintainer for current chapter |\n" +
        "| agents/chapter-drafter/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        "| agents/pov-voice-maintainer/status.json | result == 'completed' | write own status: complete |\n" +
        "| agents/pov-voice-maintainer/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        '\n' +
        '## Artifact Assignments\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Reads:** chapter-outlines/{N}.json, style-guide.json, characters/{CHAR-NNN}.json, agents/chapter-drafter/status.json, agents/pov-voice-maintainer/status.json\n' +
        '**Writes:** agents/creative-writing-coordinator/status.json\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Result Codes\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**complete**, **blocked**\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Status Contract\n' +
        '\n' +
        'When work is complete, write `status.json` with:\n' +
        '- `result`: One of the result codes listed above\n' +
