      'gen_ai.tool.type': 'function',
      'gen_ai.provider.name': 'github',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.arguments': '{"command":"cat /home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/.fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer/agents/romantic-fantasy-writer-revision-coordinator.agent.md","description":"Read revision coordinator"}',
      'gen_ai.tool.call.result': '# Revision Coordinator\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Agent ID:** A-009\n' +
        '**Level:** coordinator\n' +
        '**Parent:** romantic-fantasy-writer\n' +
        '**Children:** romantic-fantasy-writer-developmental-editor, romantic-fantasy-writer-line-editor, romantic-fantasy-writer-copy-editor, romantic-fantasy-writer-chapter-reviser, romantic-fantasy-writer-revision-auditor\n' +
        '**Pass/Phase:** revision\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Role\n' +
        '\n' +
        'Coordinator for revision phase. Dispatches specialists and manages work through this creative pass.\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Pure Router Purity Rule\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Purity Constraint:** This agent is a pure router. It must not perform substantive creative work. Its role is to:\n' +
        '- Read progress/status files from children\n' +
        '- Evaluate routing conditions\n' +
        '- Dispatch specialist agents in sequence\n' +
        '- Update progress state\n' +
        '- Write own status.json when phase is complete or blocked\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Routing Table\n' +
        '\n' +
        '| Read | Condition | Action |\n' +
        '|------|-----------|--------|\n' +
        '| agents/developmental-editor/status.json | missing (for current chapter) | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-developmental-editor for chapter N |\n' +
        "| agents/developmental-editor/status.json | result == 'completed' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-line-editor for chapter N |\n" +
        "| agents/developmental-editor/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        "| agents/line-editor/status.json | result == 'completed' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-copy-editor for chapter N |\n" +
        "| agents/line-editor/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        "| agents/copy-editor/status.json | result == 'completed' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-chapter-reviser for chapter N |\n" +
        "| agents/copy-editor/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        "| agents/chapter-reviser/status.json | result == 'completed' | dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-revision-auditor for chapter N |\n" +
        "| agents/chapter-reviser/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-auditor/status.json | result == 'passed' AND more chapters remain | update progress.json chapterProgress[N].revised=true; advance to next chapter; delete per-chapter sub-statuses; dispatch developmental-editor for next chapter |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-auditor/status.json | result == 'passed' AND all chapters revised | update progress.json chapterProgress[N].revised=true; write own status: complete |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-auditor/status.json | result == 'failed' AND chapterRetries < maxAuditorRetries | read audit-reports/revision/gate.json; delete agents/chapter-reviser/status.json, agents/revision-auditor/status.json; increment chapterRetries; re-dispatch romantic-fantasy-writer-chapter-reviser for same chapter |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-auditor/status.json | result == 'failed' AND chapterRetries >= maxAuditorRetries | write own status: blocked; summary: 'Chapter N failed revision auditor after max retries' |\n" +
        "| agents/revision-auditor/status.json | result == 'blocked' | write own status: blocked |\n" +
        '\n' +
        '## Artifact Assignments\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**Reads:** progress.json, chapters/{N}/draft.md, agents/developmental-editor/status.json, agents/line-editor/status.json, agents/copy-editor/status.json, agents/chapter-reviser/status.json, agents/revision-auditor/status.json\n' +
        '**Writes:** agents/revision-coordinator/status.json\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Result Codes\n' +
        '\n' +
        '**complete**, **blocked**, **revision-loop**\n' +
        '\n' +
        '## Status Contract\n' +
        '\n' +
        'When work is complete, write `status.json` with:\n' +
        '- `result`: One of the result codes listed above\n' +
        '- `summary`: Brief description of work completed or reason for blocking\n' +
        '- `startTime`: ISO 8601 timestamp when work began\n' +
        '- `endTime`: ISO 8601 timestamp when work completed\n' +
        '- `artifactsProduced`: List of artifact files written\n' +
        '- `metadata`: Any domain-specific metadata (invariants enforced, etc.)\n' +
        '<exited with exit code 0>'
    },
