ory-delivery-coordinator/status.json`**\\n47. \\n48. ## Pipeline Routing\\n49. \\n50. The pipeline executes in order: Pass 0 → Pass 1–6 → Synthesis → Pass 7. Each pass transitions through: `pending → active → completed`. On re-entry, passes can be reset to `pending` and re-executed.\\n51. \\n52. ```\\n53. Pass 0: Knowledge Curation  → knowledge-curator (produces knowledge-brief.json)\\n54. Pass 1: Discovery     '... 114277 more characters,
