yle-analyzer/output.md with patterns and analysis',\\n            '9. Do NOT write abstract artifacts — defer artifact creation to style-guide-writer',\\n            '10. Complete status.json with result=completed or blocked with clear reasoning'\\n        ],\\n        'invariants': ['INV-023', 'INV-024', 'INV-028'],\\n        'artifact_reads': ['story-config.json', 'referenced style sample files'],\\n        'artifact_writes': ['agents/style-analyzer/output.md'],\\n        'result_codes': ['completed', 'blocked'],\\n    },\\n\\n    'romantic-fantasy-writer-style-guide-writer': {\\n        'role': 'Produce style guide with voice calibration per POV character, scene-type tone palettes, prose quality rules. Implements INV-055/T17 (voice fingerprints) and INV-073 (publication-ready prose).',\\n        'process_steps': [\\n            '1. Read story-concept.json for overall tone and genre',\\n            '2. Read characters/{CHAR-NNN}.json for each POV character\\\\'s voice fingerprint per INV-055/T17',\\n            '3. Read style-analyzer output if available (agents/style-analyzer/output.md)',\\n            '4. Define global prose style: register (literary/contemporary/lean), narrative distance, paragraph cadence, dialogue-to-narration ratio',\\n            '5. Per POV character: create voice calibration with fingerprint, specific rules, and example sentences showing their voice in different moods',\\n            '6. Define scene-type tone palettes:',\\n            '   - Action scenes: pace, sentence rhythm, word choice patterns',\\n            '   - Romantic/intimate scenes: sensory focus, emotional depth, pacing',\\n            '   - Introspective scenes: interior monologue style, rhythm, sentence structure',\\n            '   - Dialogue-heavy scenes: balance of attribution, subtext, speech variety',\\n            '7. Set prose quality floor per INV-017: max clichés per chapter, adverb limits, passive voice limits, metaphor density ranges',\\n            '8. Define 